/P 198 0 R
/E (I mostly had a direction in my head, so I first purchased the materials and then started figuring out how to use them. My peers helped me understand what I needed to install, how to connect the components and how to start with the coding. I also used ChatGPT to understand the technical steps and to help me with the coding. I was learning these things while making the prototype, rather than knowing them before I started.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
272 0 obj
<<
