/E (After testing the components separately, I started combining them. This is the time where I faced most of the difficulties. A code that worked for one component did not work when I added another component. Sometimes the microphone worked but the other parts did not. Sometimes the sensor worked but the complete code did not work. I had to keep changing the code, uploading it, testing it and trying again.)
/Pg 21 0 R
