/Title (While learning about the Luddites, I started thinking about what happens when technology enters an existing system and changes the way people work.  I am interested in what happens to the people who are already part of a system when new technology changes it. This led me to think about a simple question: When technology changes a system, who benefits and who gets left behind?)
