/Title (I then started looking at this question through something much closer to everyday life. I looked at the shift from offline shopping to quick commerce. Earlier, buying groceries usually meant going to a nearby local shop, talking to the shopkeeper and buying what was needed. Now, with quick commerce platforms, the same things can be ordered through a phone and delivered within minutes. This change in shopping much faster and more convenient, but it also made me think about what happens to the local shops that were already part of this system.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 694 0 R
/Next 828 0 R
>>
endobj
