/Title (I started noticing that the change was not only about convenience. It also had social, political and economic effects. Small retailers could be affected as people's shopping habits changed and more people started ordering through digital platforms. There was also a question of how large quick commerce companies and small local shops could compete fairly. Economically, things like price competition, changing retail practices and minimum order conditions for free delivery could also affect small businesses.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 782 0 R
/Next 834 0 R
>>
endobj
