/Title (This brought me back to the Luddites. The Luddites had used the hammer to resist machines that they felt were threatening their livelihoods. I started asking myself, if technology is the machine of our time, then what could be the new hammer in the server room?)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 828 0 R
/Next 840 0 R
>>
