840 0 obj
<<
/Title (For me, the answer was collaboration. Instead of thinking about technology as something that has to replace the existing system, I started thinking about whether it could work with the people who are already part of that system. In the case of quick commerce, I imagined a model where local grocery stores could become part of the delivery network instead of being pushed out by it. Technology could then support the existing businesses rather than simply replacing them.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 834 0 R
/Next 846 0 R
>>
