852 0 obj
<<
/Title (After the first presentation feedback I made some changes to the phone stand. I realised that the proximity sensor could not be kept inside the stand because it needed to be outside to detect the phone. So, I made an opening in the stand and placed the sensor there. This was a small change but it was important for the phone stand to work properly.)
/Dest [30 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 847 0 R
/Next 853 0 R
>>
endobj
853 0 obj
<<
/Title (After making the changes in the phone stand, I worked on the final code and tested all the components together. I checked if the sensor could detect when the phone was close, if the microphone could detect the notification sound, and if the lights and buzzer responded at the right time.)
/Dest [30 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 847 0 R
/Prev 852 0 R
>>
endobj
