856 0 obj
<<
/Title (I had these different directions, but I realised that I was most interested in something that I experienced very directly in my own everyday life. I started looking more closely at my relationship with my phone. I noticed how a notification could interrupt whatever I was doing. I could be working, studying or doing something else, and a small sound from my phone could immediately make me look at it.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 850 0 R
/Next 860 0 R
>>
endobj
857 0 obj
<<
/Title (FIRST 3D PRINTED DUMMY)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 861 0 R
