<<
/Title (At one point, I became very frustrated with the electronics and felt that I did not want to continue anymore. There were so many small things to figure out, and sometimes I would fix one thing and another thing would stop working. But I kept testing because I wanted to see the experience I had imagined actually happen.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 873 0 R
/Next 867 0 R
>>
