<<
/Title (There were also many problems that were not related to the code like a jumper wire was not working. Sometimes a connection was loose. Sometimes I realized that I needed another material to make something work, so I had to go back to the shop and buy it.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 875 0 R
/Next 871 0 R
>>
