875 0 obj
<<
/Title (After testing the components separately, I started combining them. This is the time where I faced most of the difficulties. A code that worked for one component did not work when I added another component. Sometimes the microphone worked but the other parts did not. Sometimes the sensor worked but the complete code did not work. I had to keep changing the code, uploading it, testing it and trying again.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 876 0 R
/Next 873 0 R
>>
endobj
